},"chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen","book_id":"b-houhanshu-062","work_id":"w-houhanshu","source_id":"s-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p001","text":"孔子曰「受業身通者七十有七人」，皆異能之士也。德行：顏淵，閔子騫，冉伯牛，仲弓。政事：冉有，季路。言語：宰我，子貢。文學：子游，子夏。師也辟，參也魯，柴也愚，由也喭，回也屢空。賜不受命而貨殖焉，億則屢中。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0004","start":4,"end":9,"surface":"受業身通者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、氏族或未定指代，尚未補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0017","start":17,"end":21,"surface":"異能之士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、氏族或未定指代，尚未補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"顏淵","kind":"person","person_id":"gsq_vgq_esv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"閔子騫","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_mkq_luc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"冉伯牛","kind":"person","person_id":"n7v_qo9_v4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"仲弓","kind":"person","person_id":"5bo_dxd_69k_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"冉有","kind":"person","person_id":"wnp_vk6_qhe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"季路","kind":"person","person_id":"t7x_2x7_1fc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"宰我","kind":"person","person_id":"sng_c8u_vn9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"子貢","kind":"person","person_id":"7c4_6v2_yvm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"子游","kind":"person","person_id":"mqt_zhu_byy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"子夏","kind":"person","person_id":"z8l_wje_08d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"師","kind":"person","person_id":"482_ly0_otk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"參","kind":"person","person_id":"c7w_nyj_95u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"柴","kind":"person","person_id":"b7o_fu7_sjf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"由","kind":"person","person_id":"t7x_2x7_1fc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"回","kind":"person","person_id":"gsq_vgq_esv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"賜","kind":"person","person_id":"7c4_6v2_yvm","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p060","text":"曾參，南武城人，字子輿。少孔子四十六歳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m060-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"曾參","kind":"person","person_id":"c7w_nyj_95u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m060-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"子輿","kind":"person","person_id":"c7w_nyj_95u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m060-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p061","text":"孔子以爲能通孝道，故授之業。作孝經。死於魯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m061-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p015","text":"臣聞天下之患在於土崩，不在於瓦解，古今一也。何謂土崩？秦之末世是也。陳涉無千乘之尊，尺土之地，身非王公大人名族之后，無鄉曲之譽，非有孔、墨、曾子之賢，陶朱、猗頓之富也，然起窮巷，奮棘矜，偏袒大呼而天下從風，此其故何也？由民困而主不恤，下怨而上不知（也），俗已亂而政不修，此三者陳涉之所以為資也。是之謂土崩。故曰天下之患在於土崩。何謂瓦解？吳、楚、齊、趙之兵是也。七國謀為大逆，號皆稱萬乘之君，帶甲數十萬，威足以嚴其境內，財足以勸其士民，然不能西攘尺寸之地而身為禽於中原者，此其故何也？非權輕於匹夫而兵弱於陳涉也，當是之時，先帝之德澤未衰而安土樂俗之民眾，故諸侯無境外之助。此之謂瓦解，故曰天下之患不在瓦解。由是觀之，天下誠有土崩之勢，雖布衣窮處之士或首惡而危海內，陳涉是也。況三晉之君或存乎！天下雖未有大治也，誠能無土崩之勢，雖有彊國勁兵不得旋踵而身為禽矣，吳、楚、齊、趙是也。況群臣百姓能為亂乎哉！此二體者，安危之明要也，賢主所留意而深察也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"孔","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"墨","kind":"person","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"曾子","kind":"person","person_id":"c7w_nyj_95u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"陶朱","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"猗頓","kind":"person","person_id":"kxz_6nu_h9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0138","start":138,"end":140,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0181","start":181,"end":183,"surface":"七國","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0252","start":252,"end":254,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0261","start":261,"end":263,"surface":"先帝","kind":"person","person_id":"moo_r04_tz1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0332","start":332,"end":334,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m015-0338","start":338,"end":342,"surface":"三晉之君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen","work_id":"w-houhanshu","book_id":"b-houhanshu-062","source_id":"s-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen","source":{"title":"荀韓鍾陳列傳第五十二（數位選錄）","provider":"Kanripo","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0009/blob/6db36b6dcbe843b825354c22e9be9193d0137c04/KR2a0009_092.txt","permalink":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0009/blob/6db36b6dcbe843b825354c22e9be9193d0137c04/KR2a0009_092.txt","revision_id":"6db36b6dcbe843b825354c22e9be9193d0137c04","accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"荀氏家族相關局部選錄；不是全卷轉錄或完整人物覆核。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；保留固定數位見證及轉錄來源歸屬。","license_url":"https://www.kanripo.org/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:eight-sons:p001","source_lines":[14,27],"raw_quote":"荀淑字季和潁川潁隂人也荀卿十一世孫也(卿名况/趙人也)¶\n(為楚蘭陵令著書二十二篇號/荀卿子避宣帝諱故改曰孫也)少有髙行博學而不好¶\n<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-1b>¶\n章句多為俗儒所非而州里稱其知人安帝時徴拜郎¶\n中後再遷當塗長(當塗縣名故/城在今宣州)去職還鄉里當世名賢¶\n李固李膺等皆師宗之及梁太后臨朝有日食地震之¶\n變詔公卿舉賢良方正光禄勲杜喬少府房植舉淑對¶\n䇿譏刺貴倖為大將軍梁冀所忌出補朗陵侯相(續漢/書曰)¶\n(淑對䇿刺梁/氏故出也)莅事明理稱為神君頃之弃官歸閒居養¶\n志產業每增輒以贍宗族知友年六十七建和三年卒¶\n李膺時為尚書自表師喪(禮記曰事師無犯無隠左右/就養無方服勤至死心喪三)¶\n<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-2a>¶\n(年/)二縣皆為立祠有子八人儉緄靖燾汪爽肅專並有¶\n名稱時人謂八龍(緄音昆燾音道汪音烏光反說文云/汪深廣也俗本改作注非專本或作)¶\n","raw_quote_sha256":"32cbd6d66f071e4bd39abb7c5ecb54b874a5d556ab67f26824718decc4186d3d","body_before_excerpt_selection":"荀淑字季和潁川潁隂人也荀卿十一世孫也少有髙行博學而不好章句多為俗儒所非而州里稱其知人安帝時徴拜郎中後再遷當塗長去職還鄉里當世名賢李固李膺等皆師宗之及梁太后臨朝有日食地震之變詔公卿舉賢良方正光禄勲杜喬少府房植舉淑對䇿譏刺貴倖為大將軍梁冀所忌出補朗陵侯相莅事明理稱為神君頃之弃官歸閒居養志產業每增輒以贍宗族知友年六十七建和三年卒李膺時為尚書自表師喪二縣皆為立祠有子八人儉緄靖燾汪爽肅專並有名稱時人謂八龍","body_selection":{"start":0,"end":199,"begin_anchor":"荀淑字季和潁川潁隂人","end_anchor":"專並有名稱時人謂八龍"},"commentary":[{"raw_quote":"(卿名况/趙人也)","body_offset":18,"raw_start":18,"raw_end":27,"excerpt_body_offset":18},{"raw_quote":"(為楚蘭陵令著書二十二篇號/荀卿子避宣帝諱故改曰孫也)","body_offset":18,"raw_start":29,"raw_end":56,"excerpt_body_offset":18},{"raw_quote":"(當塗縣名故/城在今宣州)","body_offset":55,"raw_start":123,"raw_end":136,"excerpt_body_offset":55},{"raw_quote":"(續漢/書曰)","body_offset":125,"raw_start":212,"raw_end":219,"excerpt_body_offset":125},{"raw_quote":"(淑對䇿刺梁/氏故出也)","body_offset":125,"raw_start":221,"raw_end":233,"excerpt_body_offset":125},{"raw_quote":"(禮記曰事師無犯無隠左右/就養無方服勤至死心喪三)","body_offset":172,"raw_start":284,"raw_end":309,"excerpt_body_offset":172},{"raw_quote":"(年/)","body_offset":172,"raw_start":337,"raw_end":341,"excerpt_body_offset":172},{"raw_quote":"(緄音昆燾音道汪音烏光反說文云/汪深廣也俗本改作注非專本或作)","body_offset":199,"raw_start":370,"raw_end":401,"excerpt_body_offset":199}],"page_markers":[{"raw_quote":"<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-1b>","body_offset":27,"raw_offset":67},{"raw_quote":"<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-2a>","body_offset":172,"raw_offset":311}]},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:yue-intro:p001","source_lines":[166,170],"raw_quote":"恱字仲豫儉之子也儉早卒恱年十二能說春秋家貧¶\n無書每之人間所見篇牘一覽多能誦記性沈静羙姿¶\n容尤好著述靈帝時閹官用權士多退身窮處恱乃託¶\n<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-10a>¶\n疾隠居時人莫之識從弟彧特稱敬焉初辟鎮東將軍¶\n","raw_quote_sha256":"d03913956ac729e11ec7392af76ae270a2055a7416ca9b03d6f9a262b649046b","body_before_excerpt_selection":"恱字仲豫儉之子也儉早卒恱年十二能說春秋家貧無書每之人間所見篇牘一覽多能誦記性沈静羙姿容尤好著述靈帝時閹官用權士多退身窮處恱乃託疾隠居時人莫之識從弟彧特稱敬焉初辟鎮東將軍","body_selection":{"start":0,"end":78,"begin_anchor":"恱字仲豫儉之子也儉早","end_anchor":"莫之識從弟彧特稱敬焉"},"commentary":[],"page_markers":[{"raw_quote":"<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-10a>","body_offset":63,"raw_offset":69}]},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:shuang-intro:p001","source_lines":[39,40],"raw_quote":"爽字慈明一名諝(音息/汝反)幼而好學年十二能通春秋論¶\n語太尉杜喬見而稱之曰可為人師爽遂耽思經書慶¶\n","raw_quote_sha256":"c34ff57d97f368f452ed948bc4b27c64e7159eda09ffb300b9b8aa965e5c71dc","body_before_excerpt_selection":"爽字慈明一名諝幼而好學年十二能通春秋論語太尉杜喬見而稱之曰可為人師爽遂耽思經書慶","body_selection":{"start":0,"end":20,"begin_anchor":"爽字慈明一名諝","end_anchor":"能通春秋論語"},"commentary":[{"raw_quote":"(音息/汝反)","raw_start":7,"raw_end":14,"body_offset":7,"excerpt_body_offset":7}],"page_markers":[]}],"extraction_note":"按明列首尾選錄；保留原字，Kanripo正文與括號古注、頁標分離，維基文庫選句沒有模板轉換。未核書影，未完成全卷。"},"source_commit":"6db36b6dcbe843b825354c22e9be9193d0137c04","source_blob_sha":"614feff3bc8a94d5dc145f9cbdfcc3b5e43857dc","response_sha256":"55aac81cecc80987ab95b4bab053720595f4124c8fcb6f3c3ac3ebe7725018c6","edition":"WYG（文淵閣四庫全書）","response_extent":{"first_line":1,"last_line":421,"partial_file":false},"numbering_note":"通行卷六十二、列傳第五十二；此固定WYG數位見證題卷九十二，檔名KR2a0009_092.txt，兩者分存，不改原檔。"}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-067","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples","source":{"title":"史記／卷067","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷067","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷067&oldid=7869003","revision_id":7869003,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"152段正文，自孔子曰受業身通者至太史公論贊；排除ws-header中的導覽名單、後附索隱述贊及現代版權告示。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{}